    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/1585b7a6248578cc1919855300ed1328.poster.avif?t=1754436413\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/1585b7a6248578cc1919855300ed1328.webm?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/1585b7a6248578cc1919855300ed1328.mp4?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Test your wit and strategy in Everglyph Trials, a roguelite deck builder with ever-evolving choices and challenges.</strong><br>Build your deck from a variety of cards, each with a unique combination of effects. Unleash devastating combos and adapt your tactics to defeat powerful floor bosses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/bf9ee1180170e9e5c6826b4d7802784a.poster.avif?t=1754436413\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/bf9ee1180170e9e5c6826b4d7802784a.webm?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/bf9ee1180170e9e5c6826b4d7802784a.mp4?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/steam_divider.PNG?t=1754436413\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Strategic Deckbuilding:</strong> Make key card choices throughout your journey, crafting a deck to overcome difficult encounters. Experiment with combos and adapt your strategy as the battlefield evolves.<br></li><li><strong>Dual Card Effects:</strong> Every card offers two impactful options: a play effect and a reveal effect. Analyze enemies and their intentions to execute winning strategies. Will you risk high-rolling for damage this turn or set up the perfect kill for the next?</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/cc56bfcf6c7073f78274430367b245a1.poster.avif?t=1754436413\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/cc56bfcf6c7073f78274430367b245a1.webm?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/cc56bfcf6c7073f78274430367b245a1.mp4?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Synergy and Buffs:</strong> Play cards from the same elemental faction to unlock bonus effects like multicasting and stacking buffs. Unlock each hero\u2019s potential through purposeful cardplay.<br></li><li><strong>Ever-Changing Depths:</strong> Each run is unique. Explore procedurally generated levels, encounter diverse enemies with deadly skills, and discover powerful glyphs that alter your fate.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/7a0a4896741cf1b9a177a9d26db32a55.poster.avif?t=1754436413\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/7a0a4896741cf1b9a177a9d26db32a55.webm?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/7a0a4896741cf1b9a177a9d26db32a55.mp4?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A World of Magic and Beauty:</strong> Immerse yourself in a stunning hand-drawn fantasy world. Explore breathtaking landscapes, face fantastic foes, and uncover its secrets.<br></li><li><strong>The Roguelite Challenge Awaits:</strong> Test your skills. Each run offers a chance to learn, unlock permanent upgrades, and forge a path to victory.<br></li><li><strong>Hardcore Mode:</strong> Optionally increase the difficulty by venturing deeper into the trials or adding restrictions for even greater rewards.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/5e981604881864f3b557e3ca450ff150.poster.avif?t=1754436413\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/5e981604881864f3b557e3ca450ff150.webm?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005840/extras/5e981604881864f3b557e3ca450ff150.mp4?t=1754436413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
